# Data Room MVP (tailored-tech-test)

Take-home Virtual Data Room. Optimize **UX → polish → code**. Timebox ~4–6h.

## Locked (do not reopen)

- **SPA:** Vite + React + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/ui (not Next)
- **Persist:** IndexedDB via `DataRoomRepository` (Memory first, then Idb). No cloud/auth as Must
- **Files:** PDF only; object URL preview (no pdf.js unless iframe fails)
- **Move:** dialog first; `@dnd-kit` only after dialog works

## Non-negotiable

- No unimplemented UI (no Share/Auth/Search stubs)
- UI talks only to repository interface — never IDB directly from components
- Same-name → auto-suffix ` (n)`; folder delete = cascade + confirm with N
- TQ (`docs/test-task.md`) > SPEC > ADR/KB

## Kill switches

1. DnD broken → Move dialog only  
2. IDB pain → Memory + README note  
3. After ~5h → README + deploy only  
4. Extra = filename search **XOR** Supabase — not both  

